### InstantlyFeed Seed REST API Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client, IntelliJ HTTP Client, Postman, or curl

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminEmail = admin@instantlyfeed.com
@adminPassword = adminpassword123

### 1. Authenticate & Obtain JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store token for subsequent requests
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Fetch Existing Articles (Check Count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles?limit=100
Authorization: JWT {{authToken}}

### 3. Create or Ensure Author
# @name createAuthor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/authors
Authorization: JWT {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "InstantlyFeed Newsroom",
  "slug": "instantlyfeed-newsroom",
  "role": "Staff Reporter",
  "bio": "Comprehensive news coverage and analysis from our correspondents.",
  "email": "news@instantlyfeed.com"
}

@authorId = {{createAuthor.response.body.doc.id}}

### 4. Create External Media Record (Cover Image)
# @name createMedia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media
Authorization: JWT {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alt": "House Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill Targeting Corporate Homebuyers",
  "caption": "House Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill Targeting Corporate Homebuyers",
  "source": "external",
  "externalUrl": "https://instantlyfeed.com/media/sample-cover.jpg"
}

@mediaId = {{createMedia.response.body.doc.id}}

### 5. Create Article Sample via HTTP POST
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles
Authorization: JWT {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "House Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill Targeting Corporate Homebuyers",
  "slug": "house-passes-bipartisan-housing-bill-targeting-corporate",
  "excerpt": "The House delivered a massive bipartisan victory this week, passing a housing bill designed to expand homeownership, lower costs, and limit institutional buyers.",
  "status": "published",
  "publishedAt": "2026-08-24T01:34:36.010Z",
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isFeatured": true,
  "readTime": 4,
  "credit": "InstantlyFeed Wire Service",
  "coverImage": "{{mediaId}}",
  "author": "{{authorId}}",
  "tags": [
    { "tag": "politics" },
    { "tag": "housing" },
    { "tag": "economy" }
  ],
  "content": {
    "root": {
      "type": "root",
      "format": "",
      "indent": 0,
      "version": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The House delivered a massive bipartisan victory this week, passing a housing bill designed to expand homeownership, lower costs, and limit institutional homebuyers.",
              "version": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "og": {
    "metaTitle": "House Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill Targeting Corporate Homebuyers",
    "metaDescription": "The House delivered a massive bipartisan victory this week."
  },
  "meta": {
    "title": "House Passes Bipartisan Housing Bill Targeting Corporate Homebuyers",
    "description": "The House delivered a massive bipartisan victory this week."
  }
}

### 6. Delete Article by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/1
Authorization: JWT {{authToken}}

### 7. Delete Media by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/media/1
Authorization: JWT {{authToken}}
